---
title: Timeline
layout: page
description: A high-level timeline of DOGE's activities across the federal government.
index_for_search: true
---
{% import 'macros' %}
{%@ 'atoms/title', title: 'The DOGE Timeline' %}

{%@ 'text' do %}
It can be hard to see the patterns in the noise of DOGE's chaos, but there has been a structure to the destruction. In the initial phase of this site, I am focusing more on the people rather than DOGE's projects, but this timeline is an overview of DOGE's activities and shifting focus.
{% end %}

<ul class="mt-5 md:max-w-11/12 mx-auto timeline timeline-vertical timeline-snap-icon max-md:timeline-compact">
  {% timeline_start = false %}

  {% site.data.timeline.each do |tl| %}
  <li>
    {% if tl != site.data.timeline.first %}<hr/>{% end %}
    <div class="timeline-middle">
      <i class="fa-sharp fa-solid fa-burst"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="my-text prose-a:font-semibold mb-5 {% if timeline_start %}timeline-start md:text-end{% else %}timeline-end{% end %}">
        <time class="text-md lg:text-lg font-mono italic">{{ tl.date }}</time>
        <div class="text-md lg:text-lg font-black">{{ tl.title }}</div>
        <div class="text-sm sm:text-md lg:text-lg">
        {{ tl.text | linkify_text | md | strip_p }}
        </div>
        {% timeline_start = !timeline_start %}
    </div>
    {% if tl != site.data.timeline.last %}<hr/>{% end %}
  </li>
  {% end %}
</ul>
